### Swagger UI
GET https://localhost:8080/swagger-ui/index.html

### API docs
GET https://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs

### Orders list, paginated
GET https://localhost:8080/api/orders?page=0&size=20&sort=id&dir=asc
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### Users list, paginated
GET https://localhost:8080/api/users?page=0&size=20&sort=id&dir=asc
Authorization: Basic admin admin

### Transports list, already paginated
GET https://localhost:8080/api/transports?page=0&size=10&sort=transportDate&dir=asc
Authorization: Basic admin admin
